<title>Shared container Uganda → Hamburg · Next run</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/zuricaf.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/landing.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="wrap">

<div class="toggles">
  <div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Language / Sprache">
    <button type="button" data-set-lang="en" aria-pressed="true">EN</button>
    <button type="button" data-set-lang="de" aria-pressed="false">DE</button>
  </div>
</div>

<header>
  <div class="cobrand">
    <a href="/"><img class="zuricaf" src="/images/zuricaf.png" alt="Zuricaf · Farmers Direct Sourcing Co." width="915" height="408"></a>
    <span class="x" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
    <img class="littlefarms" src="/images/littlefarms.png" alt="littlefarms · coffee by farmers" width="600" height="400">
  </div>
  <div class="masthead">
    <span>Direct Trade Uganda</span>
    <span data-en="Next run · Kampala → Hamburg" data-de="Nächster Run · Kampala → Hamburg">Next run · Kampala → Hamburg</span>
  </div>

  <div class="c">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:38px" data-en="Shared container · Kampala → Hamburg" data-de="Sammelcontainer · Kampala → Hamburg">Shared container · Kampala → Hamburg</p>
  <h1 data-en="One container of East African green coffee.&lt;br&gt;Your &lt;em&gt;own&lt;/em&gt; lot." data-de="Ein Container ostafrikanischen Rohkaffees.&lt;br&gt;Dein &lt;em&gt;eigenes&lt;/em&gt; Lot.">One container of East African green coffee.<br>Your <em>own</em> lot.</h1>
  <p class="lead" data-en="We consolidate a container of Ugandan green coffee to Hamburg. You register your volume, we handle export, freight, customs clearance and warehousing. What you pay depends on how full the container gets. We confirm the rate in writing before anything is due." data-de="Wir konsolidieren einen Container ugandischen Rohkaffees nach Hamburg. Du meldest deine Menge an, wir übernehmen Export, Fracht, Verzollung und Einlagerung. Was du zahlst, hängt davon ab, wie voll der Container wird. Die Rate bestätigen wir dir schriftlich, bevor etwas fällig wird.">We consolidate a container of Ugandan green coffee to Hamburg. You register your volume, we handle export, freight, customs clearance and warehousing. What you pay depends on how full the container gets. We confirm the rate in writing before anything is due.</p>
  <p class="note" style="margin-top:24px" data-en="We name the date and booking deadline of the next run in the confirmation. Until the booking deadline the rate is indicative, after that it is fixed. You are a farmer or group in Uganda? &lt;a href=&quot;/direct-trade/&quot;&gt;Continue here.&lt;/a&gt;" data-de="Termin und Buchungsschluss des nächsten Runs nennen wir in der Bestätigung. Bis zum Buchungsschluss ist die Rate indikativ, danach fix. Du bist Farmer oder Gruppe in Uganda? &lt;a href=&quot;/direct-trade/?lang=de&quot;&gt;Hier geht es für euch weiter.&lt;/a&gt;">We name the date and booking deadline of the next run in the confirmation. Until the booking deadline the rate is indicative, after that it is fixed. You are a farmer or group in Uganda? <a href="/direct-trade/">Continue here.</a></p>
  <a class="send" href="#form" data-en="Register interest" data-de="Vormerken">Register interest</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Why this exists" data-de="Warum es das gibt">Why this exists</p>
  <p class="lead" data-en="You only get your own lot from Uganda if you fill a container. In a shared container you split it with others. Everything from the collection point in Uganda to the warehouse in Hamburg is in one price per kilo; what is not included is listed below, item by item." data-de="Ein eigenes Lot aus Uganda bekommst du sonst nur, wenn du einen Container füllst. Im Sammelcontainer teilst du ihn mit anderen. Alles von der Sammelstelle in Uganda bis zum Lager in Hamburg steckt in einem Preis je Kilo, was nicht drin ist, steht unten einzeln.">You only get your own lot from Uganda if you fill a container. In a shared container you split it with others. Everything from the collection point in Uganda to the warehouse in Hamburg is in one price per kilo; what is not included is listed below, item by item.</p>
</section>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="What the rate covers" data-de="Leistungsumfang">What the rate covers</p>
  <div class="lists">
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="Included in the rate" data-de="In der Rate enthalten">Included in the rate</h3>
      <ul class="yes">
        <li data-en="Receiving at our collection point in Uganda" data-de="Annahme an unserer Sammelstelle in Uganda">Receiving at our collection point in Uganda</li>
        <li data-en="Bagging, screening, export marking" data-de="Absacken, Screening, Exportmarkierung">Bagging, screening, export marking</li>
        <li data-en="Export clearance and documentation" data-de="Exportabfertigung und Dokumentation">Export clearance and documentation</li>
        <li data-en="Land transport to Mombasa" data-de="Landtransport bis Mombasa">Land transport to Mombasa</li>
        <li data-en="Sea freight to Hamburg" data-de="Seefracht bis Hamburg">Sea freight to Hamburg</li>
        <li data-en="Import clearance and terminal handling" data-de="Einfuhrabfertigung und Terminal Handling">Import clearance and terminal handling</li>
        <li data-en="Unloading, sorting, free storage period" data-de="Entladung, Sortierung, Freilagerung">Unloading, sorting, free storage period</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="Not included, at cost" data-de="Nicht enthalten, zu Beleg">Not included, at cost</h3>
      <ul class="no">
        <li data-en="Cess: 2% of the declared export value" data-de="Cess: 2% auf den deklarierten Exportwert">Cess: 2% of the declared export value</li>
        <li data-en="Import duty and import VAT" data-de="Einfuhrzoll und Einfuhrumsatzsteuer">Import duty and import VAT</li>
        <li data-en="Transit insurance" data-de="Transportversicherung">Transit insurance</li>
        <li data-en="Storage beyond the free period" data-de="Lagerung über die Freiperiode hinaus">Storage beyond the free period</li>
        <li data-en="Demurrage caused by missing documents or payment" data-de="Standgeld durch fehlende Papiere oder Zahlung">Demurrage caused by missing documents or payment</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Route and process" data-de="Route und Ablauf">Route and process</p>
  <svg class="gfx gfx-route" viewBox="0 0 360 130" role="img" aria-labelledby="rt-n"><title id="rt-n">Route Kampala, by road to Mombasa, by sea to Hamburg</title>
<line x1="76" y1="40" x2="164" y2="40" class="g-road"/>
<line x1="196" y1="40" x2="284" y2="40" class="g-sea"/>
<text x="120" y="26" class="g-conn" text-anchor="middle" data-en="By road" data-de="Per Lkw">By road</text>
<text x="240" y="26" class="g-conn" text-anchor="middle" data-en="By sea" data-de="Per Schiff">By sea</text>
<circle cx="60" cy="40" r="15" class="g-dot"/>
<circle cx="60" cy="40" r="5" class="g-hub"/>
<text x="60" y="80" class="g-title" text-anchor="middle" data-en="Kampala" data-de="Kampala">Kampala</text>
<text x="60" y="98" class="g-sub" text-anchor="middle" data-en="Collection point," data-de="Sammelstelle,">Collection point,</text>
<text x="60" y="114" class="g-sub" text-anchor="middle" data-en="export" data-de="Export">export</text>
<circle cx="180" cy="40" r="15" class="g-dot"/>
<circle cx="180" cy="40" r="5" class="g-hub"/>
<text x="180" y="80" class="g-title" text-anchor="middle" data-en="Mombasa" data-de="Mombasa">Mombasa</text>
<text x="180" y="98" class="g-sub" text-anchor="middle" data-en="Loading" data-de="Verladung">Loading</text>
<circle cx="300" cy="40" r="15" class="g-dot"/>
<circle cx="300" cy="40" r="5" class="g-hub"/>
<text x="300" y="80" class="g-title" text-anchor="middle" data-en="Hamburg" data-de="Hamburg">Hamburg</text>
<text x="300" y="98" class="g-sub" text-anchor="middle" data-en="Import clearance," data-de="Einfuhr,">Import clearance,</text>
<text x="300" y="114" class="g-sub" text-anchor="middle" data-en="warehouse" data-de="Lager">warehouse</text>
</svg>
  <h3 class="gap" data-en="From registration to pickup" data-de="Vom Vormerken bis zur Abholung">From registration to pickup</h3>
  <svg class="gfx" viewBox="0 0 360 372" role="img" aria-labelledby="pt-n"><title id="pt-n">Process from registration to pickup</title>
<line x1="24" y1="34" x2="24" y2="322" class="g-line"/>
<circle cx="24" cy="34" r="15" class="g-dot"/>
<text x="24" y="39" class="g-num" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
<text x="54" y="31" class="g-title" data-en="Register interest" data-de="Vormerken">Register interest</text>
<text x="54" y="48" class="g-sub" data-en="Short form, reply within two working days" data-de="Kurzes Formular, Antwort in zwei Werktagen">Short form, reply within two working days</text>
<circle cx="24" cy="106" r="15" class="g-dot"/>
<text x="24" y="111" class="g-num" text-anchor="middle">2</text>
<text x="54" y="103" class="g-title" data-en="Confirmation" data-de="Bestätigung">Confirmation</text>
<text x="54" y="120" class="g-sub" data-en="Rate, date and booking deadline in writing" data-de="Rate, Termin und Buchungsschluss schriftlich">Rate, date and booking deadline in writing</text>
<circle cx="24" cy="178" r="15" class="g-dot"/>
<text x="24" y="183" class="g-num" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
<text x="54" y="175" class="g-title" data-en="Your supplier delivers" data-de="Dein Lieferant liefert an">Your supplier delivers</text>
<text x="54" y="192" class="g-sub" data-en="Collection point Uganda, big bags or GrainPro" data-de="Sammelstelle Uganda, Big Bags oder GrainPro">Collection point Uganda, big bags or GrainPro</text>
<circle cx="24" cy="250" r="15" class="g-dot"/>
<text x="24" y="255" class="g-num" text-anchor="middle">4</text>
<text x="54" y="247" class="g-title" data-en="We bag and ship" data-de="Wir sacken ab und verschiffen">We bag and ship</text>
<text x="54" y="264" class="g-sub" data-en="The weighed net weight is the invoiced weight" data-de="Verwogenes Nettogewicht ist Abrechnungsgewicht">The weighed net weight is the invoiced weight</text>
<circle cx="24" cy="322" r="15" class="g-dot"/>
<text x="24" y="327" class="g-num" text-anchor="middle">5</text>
<text x="54" y="319" class="g-title" data-en="Pickup in Hamburg" data-de="Abholung in Hamburg">Pickup in Hamburg</text>
<text x="54" y="336" class="g-sub" data-en="Released after customs clearance," data-de="Freimeldung nach Verzollung,">Released after customs clearance,</text>
<text x="54" y="352" class="g-sub" data-en="then free storage period" data-de="dann Freilagerung">then free storage period</text>
</svg>
  <ol class="steps sr-only">
    <li><div><h3 data-en="Register interest" data-de="Vormerken">Register interest</h3><p data-en="Send the short form. We reply within two working days." data-de="Kurzes Formular senden. Antwort innerhalb von zwei Werktagen.">Send the short form. We reply within two working days.</p></div></li>
    <li><div><h3 data-en="Confirmation" data-de="Bestätigung">Confirmation</h3><p data-en="Rate, date and booking deadline in writing." data-de="Rate, Termin und Buchungsschluss schriftlich.">Rate, date and booking deadline in writing.</p></div></li>
    <li><div><h3 data-en="Your supplier delivers" data-de="Dein Lieferant liefert an">Your supplier delivers</h3><p data-en="Collection point Uganda, big bags or GrainPro." data-de="Sammelstelle Uganda, Big Bags oder GrainPro.">Collection point Uganda, big bags or GrainPro.</p></div></li>
    <li><div><h3 data-en="We bag and ship" data-de="Wir sacken ab und verschiffen">We bag and ship</h3><p data-en="The weighed net weight is the invoiced weight." data-de="Das verwogene Nettogewicht ist das Abrechnungsgewicht.">The weighed net weight is the invoiced weight.</p></div></li>
    <li><div><h3 data-en="Pickup in Hamburg" data-de="Abholung in Hamburg">Pickup in Hamburg</h3><p data-en="Released after customs clearance, then free storage period." data-de="Freimeldung nach Verzollung, dann Freilagerung.">Released after customs clearance, then free storage period.</p></div></li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section id="form" class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Register interest" data-de="Vormerken">Register interest</p>
  <h2 data-en="Tell us briefly what you need." data-de="Schreib uns kurz, was du brauchst.">Tell us briefly what you need.</h2>
  <p class="lead" data-en="No obligation. We get back to you within two working days. We ship from Uganda today; if you would rather source from Kenya or Rwanda, choose it below so we know there is demand." data-de="Unverbindlich. Wir melden uns innerhalb von zwei Werktagen. Wir verschiffen heute aus Uganda; willst du lieber aus Kenia oder Ruanda beziehen, wähl es unten aus, dann wissen wir, dass es Nachfrage gibt.">No obligation. We get back to you within two working days. We ship from Uganda today; if you would rather source from Kenya or Rwanda, choose it below so we know there is demand.</p>
  <form id="next-run" name="next-run" method="POST" action="/next-run-thanks/" data-thanks="/next-run-thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
    <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="next-run">
    <input type="hidden" name="lang" value="en">
    <p class="hp"><label>Leave empty: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="f"><label for="roastery" data-en="Roastery" data-de="Rösterei">Roastery</label><input id="roastery" name="roastery" required></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="contact" data-en="Contact name" data-de="Ansprechperson">Contact name</label><input id="contact" name="contact" required></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="email" data-en="Email" data-de="E-Mail">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" required></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="phone" data-en="Phone, optional" data-de="Telefon, optional">Phone, optional</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel"></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="origin" data-en="Origin" data-de="Herkunft">Origin</label><select id="origin" name="origin" required>
        <option value="Uganda" data-en="Uganda" data-de="Uganda">Uganda</option>
        <option value="Kenya" data-en="Kenya" data-de="Kenia">Kenya</option>
        <option value="Rwanda" data-en="Rwanda" data-de="Ruanda">Rwanda</option>
        <option value="Other" data-en="Other" data-de="Andere">Other</option>
      </select></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="volume" data-en="Rough volume, e.g. bags of 60 kg" data-de="Ungefähre Menge, z. B. Sack à 60 kg">Rough volume, e.g. bags of 60 kg</label><input id="volume" name="volume"></div>
      <div class="f full"><label for="notes" data-en="Region, processing, anything else" data-de="Region, Aufbereitung, sonst etwas">Region, processing, anything else</label><textarea id="notes" name="notes" rows="4"></textarea></div>
    </div>
    <p class="note" data-en="By sending you agree that we store your details to answer you. See the &lt;a href=&quot;/datenschutz/&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; (German). Rather email? &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:lorenz@zuricaf.com?subject=Vormerkung%20Sammelcontainer&quot;&gt;lorenz@zuricaf.com&lt;/a&gt;" data-de="Mit dem Absenden stimmst du zu, dass wir deine Angaben speichern, um zu antworten. Siehe &lt;a href=&quot;/datenschutz/&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt;. Lieber per Mail? &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:lorenz@zuricaf.com?subject=Vormerkung%20Sammelcontainer&quot;&gt;lorenz@zuricaf.com&lt;/a&gt;">By sending you agree that we store your details to answer you. See the <a href="/datenschutz/">privacy policy</a> (German). Rather email? <a href="mailto:lorenz@zuricaf.com?subject=Vormerkung%20Sammelcontainer">lorenz@zuricaf.com</a></p>
    <button type="submit" class="send" data-en="Send" data-de="Absenden">Send</button>
  </form>
</section>

<footer>
  <span>tabme UG (haftungsbeschränkt) · Zuricaf</span>
  <span><a href="mailto:lorenz@zuricaf.com">lorenz@zuricaf.com</a> · +49 160 3134000</span>
</footer>

</div>

